	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## 🏈 NCAAF Scores (FBS) — Alfred Workflow

### Triggers (`cfb` or `ncaaf`)
| Type this | What you get |
|-----------|-------------|
| `cfb` or `ncaaf` | Current week's FBS scores (Live → Upcoming → Final, Top 25 prioritized) |
| `cfb {filter}` | Filter scoreboard: `cfb top25`, `cfb sec`, `cfb texas`, `cfb live`, `cfb close` |
| `cfbr` / `ncaafr` | National Top 25 Rankings (CFP Default when available, AP Top 25 fallback) |
| `cfbr {poll}` | Switch poll: `cfbr cfp`, `cfbr ap`, `cfbr coaches` |
| `cfbs` / `ncaafs` | FBS Conference Standings (Power 4 first: SEC, Big Ten, Big 12, ACC, etc.) |
| `cfbs {conf}` | Filter standings: `cfbs sec`, `cfbs b10`, `cfbs b12`, `cfbs acc`, `cfbs sbc`, etc. |
| `cfbt {team}` / `cfbc {team}` | Team Record (`⌘` Offense, `⌥` Defense) + Full 12-Game Season Schedule inline |

### Modifier Keys
- **Scores (`cfb` / `ncaaf`)**:
  - `⌘`: Preview Last Play, Drive Summary &amp; Live Win Probability (Enter opens Box Score)
  - `⌥`: Preview Passing / Rushing / Receiving Game Leaders (Enter opens Play-by-Play)
- **Team &amp; Schedule (`cfbt` / `cfbc`)**:
  - Row 1 (`⌘` Offense stats, `⌥` Defense stats)
  - Rows 2–13: Full 12-game season schedule with W/L results, live scores, and upcoming kickoffs/TV networks
</string>
